{"steam_appid":3479420,"steam_name":"Okko The Exiled","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3479420/49102642/45382913efe9f9c84acd30cc466b35b271427537/1788787571/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1788792938","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257419064/6adcd3c7e1d4ee566fb8a340eaa7ec9adbf92217/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1788792938","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/8b2b2d52ec4ac228733b897a70fee31a4c8c178d/ss_8b2b2d52ec4ac228733b897a70fee31a4c8c178d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790777690","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/4e02c2615bcb17509bdaf1a931d2948698f568b1/ss_4e02c2615bcb17509bdaf1a931d2948698f568b1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790777690","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/93979adcdbf74c031fbae5f13809021616867507/ss_93979adcdbf74c031fbae5f13809021616867507.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790777690","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/df421132af098d197c71d9d5e6b8a16e9876234a/ss_df421132af098d197c71d9d5e6b8a16e9876234a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790777690","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/aa5ca6fd4935eb2b46376c486d8bc2e105a118d4/ss_aa5ca6fd4935eb2b46376c486d8bc2e105a118d4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790777690"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight to join the isolated world of Kutala with the heavens and fulfill an ancient oath!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to embark on an action-packed adventure where you stomp, launch, deflect and bash your way through Kutala, a land of demons, on a quest to defeat the Demon Lord Yalda and link Okko’s isolated world with the heavens! After 1,000 years of concealment, Okko is ready to wield the Mighty Fang and take down Kutala’s lords one by one. Defeat powerful foes, overcome obstacles and unleash your heart as Okko fights to fulfill an ancient oath. Enjoy meticulously hand-drawn 2D animations that bring Kutala’s characters to life in retro-inspired pixel art glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/5580fbd5d20409f28cfb5185b10e1b19.poster.avif?t=1790777690\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/5580fbd5d20409f28cfb5185b10e1b19.webm?t=1790777690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/5580fbd5d20409f28cfb5185b10e1b19.mp4?t=1790777690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore side-scrolling stages with precision platforming, link attacks to form devastating combos, send enemies flying and face down enormous bosses that require quick-thinking strategy! As capable as Okko may be, he won’t be alone in his quest. A colorful cast of allies will sell you valuable items, fill your belly and provide useful information at The Old Throne, a place of respite with its own buried secrets to uncover. Upgrade and unlock new abilities to give Okko an edge in combat, collect Deevols to unlock Underground challenge levels and more. A devilish world of discovery is at Okko’s fingertips!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/b12f82717e202d7e030742f92a92eae0.poster.avif?t=1790777690\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/b12f82717e202d7e030742f92a92eae0.webm?t=1790777690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/b12f82717e202d7e030742f92a92eae0.mp4?t=1790777690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant, hand-drawn pixel art brings Okko’s <span class=\"bb_strike\">world</span> path of destruction to life as he explores the demon lands of Kutala.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captivating soundtrack composed by an industry veteran to immerse you in Okko’s epic journey!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus Mode: consume Heart Energy and time Okko’s attacks to inflict extra damage on enemies and break their shields! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch, Stomp, Bounce, Shoot, Deflect, and more, as you send enemies flying across the screen, pop them into the air, and link attacks to form devastating combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your belly, purchase goods, and chat up a colorful cast of characters at The Old Throne, a place of respite, while also uncovering the secrets of its depths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive character portraits bring Okko's dialogue to life as the story unfolds! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Okko’s stats and unlock new abilities to give Okko an edge in combat and exploration!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Deevols to unlock Underground levels that put Okko's combat and platforming skills to the test! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/b1da7371477f7c948fa46dc9de865220.poster.avif?t=1790777690\" width=126 height=163 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/b1da7371477f7c948fa46dc9de865220.webm?t=1790777690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/c764c9366152cc21e70dd571b64223cc.apng?t=1790777690\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/c764c9366152cc21e70dd571b64223cc.poster.avif?t=1790777690\" class=\"bb_img\" width=144 height=141 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/5d864a8859488175d4c6657b17f7b731.apng?t=1790777690\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/5d864a8859488175d4c6657b17f7b731.poster.avif?t=1790777690\" class=\"bb_img\" width=92 height=99 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/c423fe386fa84f15905bbab527a1c3b5.poster.avif?t=1790777690\" width=152 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/c423fe386fa84f15905bbab527a1c3b5.webm?t=1790777690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/c3a493d9ad8c580055c79109a9e1a9ed.poster.avif?t=1790777690\" width=174 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/c3a493d9ad8c580055c79109a9e1a9ed.webm?t=1790777690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/2246c3a36a4a68030227dcdd9ce0069d.apng?t=1790777690\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/2246c3a36a4a68030227dcdd9ce0069d.poster.avif?t=1790777690\" class=\"bb_img\" width=108 height=106 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/da5ad72a74354916e732bd162868bb41.poster.avif?t=1790777690\" width=194 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/da5ad72a74354916e732bd162868bb41.webm?t=1790777690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo E8400, 3.0GHz or AMD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce 9600 GT or AMD HD 3870 512MB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Frozen Flame Interactive"],"publishers":["Eastasiasoft Limited"],"release_date":"30 Sep, 2026"}